                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/Tarun.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Tarun Chugh</div>
                <div class="h2">Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Tarun has been the transformational leader behind the sustained growth of Bajaj Life, which is now one of the fastest-growing private life insurers amongst top companies in the country. The Company is ~26K team strong, operates across over 598 branches, has India’s only Agency channel that is 100% digital with has a network of around 1.64&#43; lakh Insurance Consultants (agents). The Company offers Bespoke Banca experience to India’s leading Banks and financial institutes and is proud to have India’s leading Direct channel.<b></b></p>
<p>At Bajaj Life, every aspect of the business continues to be guided by its Customer First approach. It has enabled it to redefine its products suite, enhance its distribution, elevate and simplify its services and processes. These initiatives continue to strengthen the Company’s brand promise &#34;Life Goals. DONE.&#34;, under Tarun’s leadership. A strong advocate for innovation and employee empowerment, he has introduced several unique initiatives for customer delight as well as employee development. Today, Bajaj Life Insurance leads the industry across parameters. From its comprehensive suite of life goals enabling products, tech-empowered service eco-system, digital assets to delight all stakeholders while they engage with the Company, as well as a team that thinks innovation and delivers on customer delight.</p>
<p>Tarun’s rich industry tenure of over three decades, includes leadership roles at PNB Met Life and ICICI Prudential Life Insurance. His rich experience continues to fuel his transformational approach to create sustained innovation and growth within the Company. His engagement extends to industry and academia. He serves on governing councils and advisory boards, including IIM Sambalpur. An IIT Delhi and IIM Lucknow alumnus, Tarun resides with his family in Mumbai.</p></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Amit Jaiswal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Distribution Officer - Proprietary Sales Force&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/amit-jaiswal.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Amit Jaiswal<br />Chief Distribution Officer - Proprietary Sales Force</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Amit Jaiswal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Distribution Officer - Proprietary Sales Force&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/amit-jaiswal-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Amit Jaiswal</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Distribution Officer - Proprietary Sales Force</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Amit Jaiswal heads the Direct Distribution channel as Chief Distribution Officer – Proprietary Sales Force.</p>
<p>With close to 25 years of diverse experience spanning trade marketing, business development, new distribution set-ups, sales automation, and P&amp;L management, he brings deep cross-sector expertise across FMCG, Life, and Health Insurance. Having driven business growth across India, he has consistently delivered strong performance in high-intensity, dynamic environments, building scalable and sustainable distribution capabilities.</p>
<p>In his current role, Amit leads the Company’s proprietary sales vertical, driving scale and accelerating sustainable business growth. Under his leadership, within just four years of inception, the proprietary distribution channel has emerged as one of the top two direct channels in the Indian life insurance industry and continues to be among the fastest growing. In addition, he oversees the Company’s partnership with India Post Payments Bank and leads the defense business portfolio.</p>
<p>Prior to Bajaj Life, Amit has worked with organizations such as ICICI Prudential, PNB MetLife, Diageo, Amway and USL, with business footprints across India. In his various roles, he has successfully driven high-value revenue and profit plans, implemented large-scale cost savings, built prolific strategic alliances, and improved organizational productivity and performance. He has demonstrated strengths in identifying and eliminating operational deficiencies and business pain points towards improving overall business growth.</p>
<p>Amit holds a Master of Business Administration (MBA) from LBSIMT and a Bachelor’s degree in Economics (Hons) from Delhi University. He is also a Six Sigma Black Belt. Outside of work, he enjoys travelling and spending time outdoors. A strong advocate of fitness, he is also a licensed scuba diver.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Anil PM&lt;br>&lt;span>President – Legal, Compliance and Fraud Prevention Unit&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/anil-pm.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Anil PM<br />President – Legal, Compliance and Fraud Prevention Unit</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Anil PM&lt;br>&lt;span>President – Legal, Compliance and Fraud Prevention Unit&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/anil-pm-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Anil PM</div>
                <div class="h2">President – Legal, Compliance and Fraud Prevention Unit</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Anil is a qualified lawyer with over 29 years of legal experience, the majority of which has been as in-house counsel with companies in the insurance sector.</p>
<p>In his current role, Anil is responsible for providing strategic advice and opinions on legal compliance, and business issues. He focuses on ensuring Company’s conformity with the applicable laws, managing regulatory audits and inspections, and preventing and mitigating fraud. Anil plays a critical role in representing the organization during the development of growth-centric regulations in the sector. He has been a part of various IRDAI and Life Council Committees in his current role.</p>
<p>Anil has also worked with other leading life insurers, including PNB MetLife India and Aviva Life Insurance. Apart from life insurance, he has worked with Quark Media House and BEA Systems Pvt. Ltd. Before transitioning to corporate roles, Anil practiced law before the Madras High Court and had brief stints with a law firm and a telecom company in the USA.</p>
<p>Anil completed his Bachelors in Law from Dr. Ambedkar Government Law College, Chennai, and his Master of laws   from the University of Minnesota, Minneapolis, USA. He is married to Devi and has two children, Tara and Akshay. He is an avid off-road enthusiast and loves traveling.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Avdhesh Gupta&lt;br>&lt;span>Appointed Actuary&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/avdesh.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Avdhesh Gupta<br />Appointed Actuary</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Avdhesh Gupta&lt;br>&lt;span>Appointed Actuary&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/avdesh-gupta-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Avdhesh Gupta</div>
                <div class="h2">Appointed Actuary</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Gupta is the Appointed Actuary at Bajaj Life Insurance. In this role, he provides strategic leadership to the actuarial function, overseeing statutory and embedded value valuations, shareholder reporting, IFRS reporting, product pricing, and risk management. He plays a key role in supporting the Company’s long-term growth, capital efficiency, and risk governance.</p>
<p>With nearly two decades of experience across life insurance, reinsurance, and consulting, Avdhesh brings a well-rounded perspective to business and risk decision-making. Prior to Bajaj Life, he was Principal Consultant – Actuarial Services at PricewaterhouseCoopers (PwC), advising senior management of insurers on risk management, capital management, and audits. His earlier leadership roles include positions at Aegon Life Insurance, Swiss Re, and HSBC.</p>
<p>Avdhesh is a Fellow of the Institute of Actuaries of India (FIAI) and the Institute &amp; Faculty of Actuaries (FIA), UK, and holds an MSc in Actuarial Management from Cass Business School, London.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Chandramohan Mehra&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Marketing Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/CM.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Chandramohan Mehra<br />Chief Marketing Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Chandramohan Mehra&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Marketing Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/Chandra-mowli-second.png" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Chandramohan Mehra</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Marketing Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>A results-driven marketing professional with deep cross-discipline expertise, Chandramohan Mehra (CM) leads strategic marketing, brand management, consumer research, digital marketing, customer experience measurement, and in-house online business.</p>
<p>Chandramohan joined Bajaj Life in January 2018 and has been instrumental in transforming the brand into one of India’s most trusted and visible life insurers.</p>
<p>He has delivered several innovative and endearing campaigns under the umbrella of &#34;Samjho Hogaya&#34; to fulfil the brand’s promise of &#34;Life Goals. DONE.&#34; Additionally, he created the company’s marquee events - Bajaj Life Plankathon, which brought the organization Guinness World Records, and Bajaj Pune Half Marathon, which have successfully connected with diverse stakeholder groups and enhanced the company’s mindshare among consumers.</p>
<p>An industry veteran with over 25 years of experience, Chandramohan has held senior leadership positions at Sony Pictures Networks India, SBI Life Insurance, and Kotak Life. He is an alumnus of INSEAD and BITS Pilani.</p>
<p>He is passionate about long-distance running and continues to participate in several international marathons.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Dheeraj Sehgal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Business Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/Dheeraj.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Dheeraj Sehgal<br />Chief Business Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Dheeraj Sehgal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Business Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
