              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/Dheeraj-Sehgal-second.png" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Dheeraj Sehgal</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Business Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Dheeraj Sehgal is the Chief Business Officer at Bajaj Life. A results-driven professional, he brings with him over two decades of experience in the financial services and pharmaceutical industries, building new business models and defining business strategies. Dheeraj has a track record of successfully leading large teams and projects and is known for fostering long-lasting alliances.<b></b></p>
<p>Prior to joining Bajaj Life, Dheeraj has worked with renowned organizations like ICICI Securities, The Hollard Insurance Company, ICICI Prudential Life, Merck Ltd and Lupin Ltd, and was instrumental for all of them in driving superior business performance.</p>
<p>Dheeraj is a Chartered Wealth Manager from the American Academy of Financial Management and has done a Senior Management Program from IIM Calcutta.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Goutam Datta&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Information &amp; Digital Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/gautam.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Goutam Datta<br />Chief Information &amp; Digital Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Goutam Datta&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Information &amp; Digital Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/gautam-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Goutam Datta</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Information &amp; Digital Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Goutam is the <b>Chief Information &amp; Digital Officer at Bajaj Life</b>, responsible for leading the Company’s enterprise technology and digital function. Since joining the organisation in <b>November 2018</b>, he has been driving technology strategy, strengthening digital platforms, advancing data and analytics capabilities, and leading large-scale transformation initiatives to enhance customer experience and operational efficiency.</p>
<p>With over two decades of experience in technology leadership, Goutam has successfully delivered enterprise-wide digital roadmaps while managing complex technology ecosystems. He works closely with business leaders across the organisation to ensure technology priorities are aligned with business strategy and support growth, innovation, and improved customer outcomes.</p>
<p>Under his leadership, Bajaj Life has accelerated its transition from traditional operating models to digitally enabled, customer-centric processes, delivering measurable impact through technology-led transformation and innovation.</p>
<p>A collaborative leader, Goutam strongly advocates a <b>business–technology partnership</b>, engaging actively with business leaders and teams to shape tech priorities and enable scalable digital solutions that improve efficiency and unlock new opportunities.</p>
<p>Prior to joining <b>Bajaj Life</b>, Goutam led the <b>Technology &amp; Digital Innovation function at ICICI Lombard General Insurance Company</b>, where he drove business technology transformation and implemented AI-led platforms to modernise insurance processes. He has also worked with <b>Essel Group of Companies</b> and <b>Tata Infotech Ltd.</b></p>
<p>Goutam is an alumnus of the <b>Indian Institute of Management, Calcutta</b>. Outside of work, he enjoys playing competitive badminton.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Sameer Joshi&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Agency Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/Mancom_240X240_11.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Sameer Joshi<br />Chief Agency Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Sameer Joshi&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Agency Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/Sameer-Joshi.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Sameer Joshi</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Agency Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>As the leader of the Agency business channel, Sameer anchors his business strategies on the promise of delivering superior customer experience. He empowers the large force of the Company’s Insurance Consultants (ICs, or agents as popularly known in the industry) with digital assets and easy to access knowledge of the Company’s value-packed life insurance products and seamless services. He consistently invests towards training and development of the ICs to ensure they understand the customers’ Life Goals and respond to their needs accordingly.</p>
<p>Sameer has been with Bajaj Life Insurance since 2014 and also led the HR function at the Company. Sameer has spent nearly 17 years in the life insurance sector, and is a seasoned leader with a focus of driving businesses to the path of profitability. A result-oriented distribution specialist, Sameer is skilled in business planning, sales and talent management.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Bajaj Life Insurance, Sameer worked with HDFC Life and ICICI Prudential Life leading different business channels. Sameer is a Physics graduate and has completed his MMS in Marketing from Mumbai University. He enjoys teaching and playing Table Tennis.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Srinivas Rao Ravuri&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Investment Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/srinivas.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Srinivas Rao Ravuri<br />Chief Investment Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Srinivas Rao Ravuri&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Investment Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/srinivas-rao.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Srinivas Rao Ravuri</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Investment Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Srinivas Rao Ravuri, the Chief Investment Officer at Bajaj Life Insurance, brings over three decades of expertise in investment research and fund management in Indian financial markets. He began his career as an analyst in 1994 at India&#39;s first boutique equity research firm and spent 25 years covering sectors such as Real Estate, Infrastructure, Industrials, Telecom, and Power at various firms.</p>
<p>His career includes key roles at top institutions like PGIM India Asset Management and HDFC Asset Management. He joined Bajaj Life from PGIM India Asset Management, where he played a key role in transforming the AMC into one of the fastest growing AMCs in the country.</p>
<p>Srinivas holds a Bachelor’s degree in Commerce and an MBA from Osmania University, Hyderabad. Beyond his professional achievements, he is an avid tennis player and nature enthusiast, and enjoys spending time outdoors. His passion for Indian classical music further highlights his diverse interests.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Santanu Banerjee&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Human Resources Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/revamp-images/Shantanu.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Santanu Banerjee<br />Chief Human Resources Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Santanu Banerjee&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Human Resources Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/shantanu-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Santanu Banerjee</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Human Resources Officer (CHRO)</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Santanu is Chief Human Resource Officer at Bajaj Life. He brings over 26 years of experience &amp; expertise in Human Resource, Talent Management, Learning &amp; Development &amp; Administration across various sector including Manufacturing, Retail, Telcom &amp; Insurance.</p>
<p>In his current role, he heads the Company’s People, Admin &amp; Infra strategy, overseeing critical areas of Talent Acquisition &amp; Management, Employee Engagement &amp; Wellbeing, Learning &amp; Development, Performance Management, Succession Planning, as well as Infrastructure and Administration.</p>
<p>Since joining, he has played a key role in strengthening the organization’s people practices, shaping a progressive culture, sustained scaling up of capacity towards distribution delivery and improved employee capability. </p>
<p>Prior to Bajaj Life, Santanu served as Chief Human Resources Officer at Star Union Dai-ichi Life Insurance. He has also held senior HR leadership roles at ING Vysya Life Insurance, Aditya Birla Sun Life Insurance, Aditya Birla Health Insurance and Hathway Cable &amp; Datacom.</p>
<p>Santanu graduated from the University of Calcutta and holds a Master’s degree in Human Resources from the Army Institute of Management, Kolkata.</p>
<p>Outside of work, he is a trained classical musician and an enthusiastic table tennis player.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Vipin Bansal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Financial Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/vipin.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Vipin Bansal<br />Chief Financial Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Vipin Bansal&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Financial Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
