              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/vipin-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Vipin Bansal</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Financial Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Vipin Bansal is the Chief Financial Officer at Bajaj Life. He leads the organisation’s financial strategy with a strong focus on governance, capital efficiency, risk management and sustainable value creation.</p>
<p>With over two decades of experience across Financial Reporting, Risk Management, and M&amp;A, Vipin has worked across diverse sectors including BFSI, manufacturing, retail, FMCG, logistics, and metals. He has held leadership roles at Bajaj Finserv Limited spanning Risk, M&amp;A, Internal Audit, and ESG, contributing to strengthening enterprise-wide controls and driving strategic growth initiatives.</p>
<p>Prior to this, he was associated with PricewaterhouseCoopers (PwC) and its network firms, where he served as a Partner in the Assurance Practice, advising leading organisations on financial reporting and regulatory matters.</p>
<p>Vipin is a Chartered Accountant from the <b>Institute of Chartered Accountants of India</b> and holds a Bachelor of Commerce degree from <b>Nagpur University</b>.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="leder-item" attr2="Vivek Gupta&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Operations &amp; Customer Experience Officer&lt;/span>">
          <div class="lederitem-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/vivek-gupta.webp" alt=""/>
          </div>
          <div class="lederitem-details">
            <div class="h4">Vivek Gupta<br />Chief Operations &amp; Customer Experience Officer</div>

          </div>
          <div id="Leadership Team Vivek Gupta&lt;br>&lt;span>Chief Operations &amp; Customer Experience Officer&lt;/span>" class="lederhover-con dsp-none">
            <div class="lederhover-box">
              <div class="lederhover_closesvg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.00049 17.5864C4.60999 17.977 4.61005 18.6101 5.00061 19.0006C5.39117 19.3911 6.02433 19.3911 6.41482 19.0005L12.0001 13.4143L17.5858 19C17.9763 19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 19 19C19.3905 18.6095 19.3905 17.9763 19 17.5858L13.4142 12L18.9996 6.41359C19.39 6.02303 19.39 5.38987 18.9994 4.99938C18.6089 4.60888 17.9757 4.60894 17.5852 4.9995L11.9999 10.5858L6.41414 4.99998C6.02362 4.60946 5.39045 4.60946 4.99993 4.99998C4.6094 5.39051 4.6094 6.02367 4.99993 6.4142L10.5859 12.0001L5.00049 17.5864Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-img">
                <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/aboutus/vivek-gupta-pop-up.webp" alt=""/>
                
              </div>
              <div class="lederh-details">
                <div class="h1">Vivek Gupta</div>
                <div class="h2">Chief Operations &amp; Customer Experience Officer</div>
                <div class="leaders_desc"><p>Vivek Gupta serves as the Chief Operations &amp; Customer Experience Officer at Bajaj Life Insurance. With over two decades of experience in the insurance industry, he has been instrumental in driving business transformation, innovation, and strategic growth. Recognized for championing initiatives such as Virtual Reality and Conversational AI, Vivek has consistently led efforts to enhance customer engagement and redefine industry practices through technology-driven innovation.</p>
<p>Vivek oversees the Company&#39;s end-to-end Operations and Customer Experience charter, bringing together strategic vision and execution excellence under a unified operating framework. Leveraging the expertise and discipline developed during his tenure as Head of Strategy of the Company, he is focused on driving large-scale operational transformation while ensuring superior customer and partner experiences.</p>
<p>Vivek&#39;s mandate spans key operational and customer-facing functions, including policy servicing, claims management, risk governance, renewals, grievance redressal, branch operations, business continuity, digital self-service platforms, and distributor and partner engagement. He is committed to simplifying processes, enhancing service efficiency, and building seamless customer journeys across the policy lifecycle.</p>
<p>Passionate about innovation and customer-centricity, Vivek leads the integration of strategy, operations and Artificial Intelligence to create a more agile and responsive organization. His ability to combine long-term strategic thinking with rigorous execution is helping drive sustainable business outcomes and strengthen Bajaj Life Insurance&#39;s commitment to delivering simpler, smarter, and more personalized experiences for customers and distribution partners.</p>
<p>As the insurance landscape continues to evolve, Vivek remains focused on leveraging digital capabilities, operational excellence, and customer insights to accelerate growth, improve retention, and reinforce Bajaj Life Insurance&#39;s position as a trusted life insurance partner.</p>
</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="leader-description"><p> </p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
<p><a target="_blank" href="/key-management-persons.html" class="fs12" rel="noopener noreferrer">Details of Key Management Persons as per IRDAI (CG) Regulations, 2024</a></p>
</div>
    </div>

    
  
    

